    "markdown": "---\nengine: knitr\n---\n# Dictionary\n![](/images/dictionary.png){style=\"width:200px; background:white; border-radius:5px; border: 5px solid white\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\nThe third data structure we will learn is the **<u id='dictionary_tooltip'>dictionary</u>**. \nA __<u id='dictionary_tooltip'>dictionary</u>__ is an ordered data structure which holds **pairs** of values; a **key** and a **value**.\n\nFor example, say we want to store the gene identifiers alongside our fold-change data that we recorded earlier in a __<u id='list'>list</u>__. \nEach gene identifier/fold-change pair is the __key__/__value__ of the __<u id='dictionary_tooltip'>dictionary</u>__.\n\n__<u id='dictionary_tooltip'>Dictionaries</u>__ are also defined using the curly braces but a pair of values are given each time, separated by a colon (`{key:value}`).\n\nEnter the following. \n\n__Note__: You need to press enter after each line.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.python .cell-code}\ngene_fold_change = {\n  \"Agl\" : 0.25,\n  \"Pygm\" : -0.42,\n  \"Pgm2\" : 0.62,\n  \"Ugp2\" : 1.27,\n  \"Gys1\" : -0.5,\n  \"Phka1\" : 0,\n  \"Phkg1\" : 0.33\n}\ngene_fold_change\n```\n:::\n\n\n__<u id='dictionary_tooltip'>Dictionaries</u>__ are **indexed** meaning that individual records can be retrieved \nvery quickly (important if you are working with very large dictionaries).\n\nWe can retrieve the information for \"Gys1\" by using the identifier as the **key** \nand the __<u id='dictionary_tooltip'>dictionary</u>__ will then return the **value**.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.python .cell-code}\ngene_fold_change[\"Gys1\"]\n```\n:::\n\n\nNew values can be added to the __<u id='dictionary_tooltip'>dictionary</u>__ in a similar way to how they are retrieved:\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.python .cell-code}\ngene_fold_change[\"ZT1\"] = 3.2\ngene_fold_change[\"ZT1\"]\n```\n:::\n\n\nYou __cannot__ subset __<u id='dictionary_tooltip'>dictionaries</u>__ with numbers like a __<u id='list'>list</u>__.\n\nThe pairing up of values in __<u id='dictionary_tooltip'>dictionaries</u>__ is extremely useful if you are working with DNA sequence files (Fasta or FastQ).\nIt offers an easy way of matching up the read identifier with the DNA nucleotide data, for example. \nOnce indexed, the individual records can then be accessed extremely quickly.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-20f6a18c72fa56db2c22\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-20f6a18c72fa56db2c22\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"list\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"list = [value1,value2]\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-303ca58d52b9879f41f0\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-303ca58d52b9879f41f0\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"set_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"set{unique_value1,unique_value2}\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-a8fa1536d0e37de9f58e\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-a8fa1536d0e37de9f58e\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"dictionary_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"dictionary = {key:value}\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-ea1204199aaf80a54733\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-ea1204199aaf80a54733\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"function\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"function_name(variable)\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-0fbcb0451643fe9165ad\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-0fbcb0451643fe9165ad\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"method\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"variable.method_name()\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-53e9f1bece67e77794c3\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-53e9f1bece67e77794c3\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"operator\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"+, -, *, /, and more\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-0a601462b643cf3d1bfe\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-0a601462b643cf3d1bfe\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"string\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Text, denoted by quotes (\\\"text\\\" or 'text')\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-1befaf6ae94099db3edf\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-1befaf6ae94099db3edf\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"integer\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Whole numbers, e.g. 1, 2, 3, etc\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-8061ebb63ab12d2064d1\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-8061ebb63ab12d2064d1\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"float\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Real numbers (can contain decimal point), e.g. 1, 2.5, 3.14, etc\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-b262dd3a593f2921425b\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-b262dd3a593f2921425b\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"boolean\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"True or False\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-1bb82fb62cdf1dee8f11\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-1bb82fb62cdf1dee8f11\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"variable\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Container of information with a name\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-4e1e5cf71fa95508db74\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-4e1e5cf71fa95508db74\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"class\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Type of data, e.g. string, integer, float, boolean, etc.\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n",
